/* ===== FAMILY LIFE (Life → Family): ONE shared calendar, individual character records, life timeline =====
   The only clock is the game's month counter S.month (advanced only by next()). Month index m = S.month-1 (0 = January of FAM_Y0).
   Nobody's age is ever stored or incremented: age = floor((m - birthMonth) / 12), frozen at the death month for the deceased.
   famSync() is idempotent: it processes every calendar month exactly once (F.cal.proc remembers the last processed month). */
