function kidPlan(){if(FAMBUSY)return;const F=S.fam,cur=calM();closeModal();if(kidCan()||S.cash<DCOST.birth)return toast(kidCan()||NOFUND,'bad');FAMBUSY=true;
 try{if(!lspend(DCOST.birth,'Family','Pregnancy & birth preparation',{to:'Hospital'}))return;F.preg={id:'PG'+F.cn+':'+cur,start:cur,due:cur+9,rdy:0};famEv(F,cur,'baby',[F.pid,famMe().sp],`You and ${spouseOf().fn} are expecting a baby, due ${dateOf(cur+9)}.`,'preg:'+F.preg.id,-DCOST.birth);dtDone();toast('👶 You are expecting! The baby is due in 9 months.','good')}finally{FAMBUSY=false}}
function kidGo(type,tok){if(FAMBUSY)return;const F=S.fam,p=famMe(),s=spouseOf(),cur=calM(),fn=($('#kn')&&$('#kn').value||'').trim(),ok=/^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z .'-]{0,19}$/;let sx=$('#ks')?$('#ks').value:'M';
 if(!ok.test(fn))return toast('Use 1–20 letters for the name.','bad');if(F.keys['kid:'+tok])return closeModal();if(!s)return toast('You must be married.','bad');
 let age=0,cost=0;if(type==='adopt'){const w=kidCan();if(w)return toast(w,'bad');age=Math.max(0,Math.min(8,parseInt($('#ka').value,10)||0));cost=DCOST.adopt;if(S.cash<cost)return toast(NOFUND,'bad')}
 else{if(!F.preg||F.preg.id!==tok||!F.preg.rdy)return;}
 if(sx==='R')sx=Math.random()<.5?'M':'F';FAMBUSY=true;
 try{if(cost&&!lspend(cost,'Family','Adoption of '+fn,{to:'Adoption agency'}))return;F.keys['kid:'+tok]=1;
  const fa=p.sx==='M'?p:s.sx==='M'?s:p,mo=fa===p?s:p,b=cur-age*12-(age?Math.floor(rnd(0,12)):0);
  const k=famAdd(F,{fn,sn:p.sn,sx,b,f:fa.id,m:mo.id,gen:p.gen+1,kid:type==='adopt'?'adopted':'birth',edu:eduOf(age),job:'Student',hap:90,sp:null});
  F.preg=null;F.lastKid=cur;p.hap=Math.min(100,p.hap+8);s.hap=Math.min(100,s.hap+8);
  famEv(F,cur,'baby',[k.id,p.id,s.id],type==='adopt'?`${p.fn} and ${s.fn} adopted ${k.fn} ${k.sn} (age ${age}).`:`${k.fn} ${k.sn} was born to ${p.fn} and ${s.fn}.`,null,cost?-cost:0);
  closeModal();coin();dtDone();pop(type==='adopt'?'🤝 WELCOME HOME!':'👶 IT IS A '+(k.sx==='M'?'BOY':'GIRL')+'!',`${esc(k.fn)} ${esc(k.sn)} joins your family. Find ${k.sx==='M'?'him':'her'} in Family.`)}finally{FAMBUSY=false}}
// monthly hook (runs once per calendar month from famMonth): baby due date + children's schooling stage
function famPost(F,m,note){if(F.preg&&!F.preg.rdy&&m>=F.preg.due){F.preg.rdy=1;famEv(F,m,'baby',[F.pid],'Your baby is due! Go to Family → Planning to welcome and name the child.','due:'+F.preg.id);note('👶 Your baby is due! Name your child in Family → Planning.','good')}
 F.ppl.forEach(c=>{if(!c.kid||(c.d!=null&&c.d<=m))return;const a=ageAt(c,m),e=eduOf(a);if(c.edu!==e){c.edu=e;if(a>=3&&a<18)famEv(F,m,'edu',[c.id],`${c.fn} started ${e.toLowerCase()}.`,'ed:'+c.id+':'+e);c.job=a<18?'Student':c.job}})}
